            <div xml:id="d293">

                <pb facs="0434" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg420"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.35/10–1845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Cabot</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-18T16:00:00-03:00">October 18, 1945—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 18—2:48 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2577. Would appreciate immediate instructions as to whether I am to continue
                    relations with Argentine Government. I see little legal excuse for withdrawing
                    recognition but question of our position in event of civil war makes
                    consideration this problem appear advisable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cabot</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
